Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.91,0:00:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.95,0:00:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These words lured men to\Nthe Grand Line in pursuit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.31,0:00:26.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of dreams greater than\Nthey'd ever dared to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.83,0:00:29.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.61,0:00:34.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.71,0:00:40.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.53,0:00:42.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.01,0:00:52.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compass left behind,\Nit'll only slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.67,0:00:58.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your heart will be your guide,\Nraise the sails and take the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.51,0:01:04.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That legendary place that\Nthe end of the map reveals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.21,0:01:10.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is only legendary until\Nsomeone proves it real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.23,0:01:14.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through it all, through\Nall the trouble and times.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.59,0:01:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the heartache\Nand through the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.91,0:01:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that I will be there to stand by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.57,0:01:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I know you'll stand by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.23,0:01:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come aboard and bring along\NAll your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.43,0:01:36.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\NThat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.17,0:01:39.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's always room for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.77,0:01:42.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wanna be my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.15,0:01:46.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are, we are on a cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.39,0:01:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.07,0:01:54.91,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(727,0)\3c&H1E1E1E&\c&H1E1E1E&\bord2.3\1a&HFF&\t(686,727,\1a&H00&)}For Whom the Bell Tolls
Dialogue: 2,0:01:50.07,0:01:54.91,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(727,0)\c&HE7E6E6&\bord0\4a&HFF&}For Whom the Bell Tolls
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.01,0:01:56.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, he just...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.41,0:01:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just broke Captain Kudo's cat claw.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.07,0:02:05.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That leaves only five more\Nof those weird swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.53,0:02:09.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.83,0:02:11.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can still fight plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.33,0:02:14.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he still has another\Nclaw. You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.31,0:02:16.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rip that Katorea shrimp, Captain Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.81,0:02:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't use that name anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.55,0:02:19.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't like it, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.01,0:02:23.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think in this village his\Nname is Kla-ha... something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.41,0:02:28.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kla-ha something! Yeah! Kla-ha\Nsomething! Get him! Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.11,0:02:31.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouths!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.19,0:02:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.39,0:02:41.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come out, you brats!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.39,0:02:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're hiding!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.17,0:02:45.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give yourselves up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.83,0:02:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come over here and we'll take you to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.35,0:02:52.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just don't kill us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.57,0:02:56.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think I'm stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.59,0:02:59.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't fall for that, you silly rugrats.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.09,0:03:03.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.43,0:03:07.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got him! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.65,0:03:12.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pepper attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.41,0:03:24.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Achoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.41,0:03:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,End of the line, hypnotist!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.75,0:03:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you bit off a little\Nmore than you could chew.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.31,0:03:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.37,0:03:59.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We failed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.09,0:04:04.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Real pirates don't take kindly to\Nbeing mocked by the likes of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.13,0:04:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Onion!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.31,0:04:09.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You pretend, pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.91,0:04:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure got in over your heads, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.01,0:04:18.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rich girl, I know you're here. Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.93,0:04:22.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless you show yourself, I'll\Nexecute these three little lambs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.59,0:04:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I will make sure to do\Nit in a most painful fashion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.61,0:04:29.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not doubt my skill at such a task.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.77,0:04:39.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.29,0:04:42.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Kaya, run for your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.33,0:04:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.24,0:04:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's them, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.23,0:04:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're the other way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.87,0:04:50.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon enough, I'll deal with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.89,0:04:54.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the only appropriate\Nmanner, extermination.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.51,0:04:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll also kill that full jungle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.89,0:05:00.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why kill us, captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.15,0:05:02.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, please don't\Ntalk around like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.53,0:05:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, guru, it's still not too late\Nfor us to attack the village, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.37,0:05:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.28,0:05:08.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if captain jungle gets her to write,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.07,0:05:11.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,her will, then your plan\Nshould still work perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.35,0:05:16.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This plan is no longer\Nany of your concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.71,0:05:21.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When all of you are dead, this village\Nwill know who to blame for this atrocity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.25,0:05:27.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never intended to let any of you\Nmongrels leave this village alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.23,0:05:28.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.81,0:05:29.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.87,0:05:33.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows my true identity can be\Nallowed to live to tell about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.19,0:05:35.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.25,0:05:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had already planned to kill every\Nlast one of us from the very beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.53,0:05:42.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.53,0:05:47.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three years ago, I planned\Nto erase Captain Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.33,0:05:50.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And every last person who ever knew him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.91,0:05:53.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all part of my plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.37,0:05:57.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.03,0:06:00.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the most Uncle pirates I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.65,0:06:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're Uncle, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.67,0:06:05.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates are nothing more than savages.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.79,0:06:08.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incapable of rising above\Ntheir animal nature!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.27,0:06:12.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without my plans, what could\Nthey possibly accomplish?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.61,0:06:14.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A crew is nothing to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.31,0:06:16.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are simply a means to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.31,0:06:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crew members are just pawns\Nin the captain's game.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.13,0:06:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whether my men live or die\Nis up to me and me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.53,0:06:26.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I tell them to fight, they will fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.93,0:06:29.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if I order them to\Ndie, they had better do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.87,0:06:32.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They know the punishment for disobedience.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.77,0:06:36.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is how pirates are!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.55,0:06:39.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare talk down to me, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.79,0:06:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.70,0:06:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no matter how many hundreds or thousands\Nof men follow you as their captain,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.95,0:06:54.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you will never be as good as Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.35,0:06:58.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.57,0:07:04.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you saying that I am inferior to a kid\Npretending to be a pirate? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.05,0:07:08.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, aren't you funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.11,0:07:13.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get all cocky just because\Nyou snapped off one of my cat claws.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.33,0:07:15.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How exactly is he better than me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.37,0:07:17.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.27,0:07:23.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause he's got heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.33,0:07:25.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.71,0:07:30.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A guy like you doesn't\Nknow what a true pirate is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.15,0:07:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.23,0:07:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He kept up with the pussyfoot maneuver!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.05,0:07:51.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How insulting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.07,0:07:59.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would appear that you need a\Nlesson in what real pirates are like.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.03,0:08:02.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not pleasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.99,0:08:05.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your first lesson will be about terror.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.33,0:08:09.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A lesson I learned well\Nas I stared down death.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.61,0:08:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, should he be in that stance?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.29,0:08:18.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, this is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.31,0:08:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is he using that technique?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.53,0:08:23.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's only fighting one guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.57,0:08:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no reason to use\Nthe out-of-the-back attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.09,0:08:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't a good spot for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.07,0:08:31.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, he can get us, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.49,0:08:34.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he did say he was\Ngoing to kill us all earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.15,0:08:38.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Captain Kaido,\Nanything but that technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.37,0:08:39.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll do anything, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.47,0:08:42.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Captain Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.59,0:08:44.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.73,0:08:47.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just swaying back and forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.97,0:08:51.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of the back attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.83,0:09:03.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a small haul!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.37,0:09:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I really thought they'd\Nhave more treasure than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.77,0:09:11.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see if the fight is over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.89,0:09:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.80,0:09:15.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone has stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.13,0:09:17.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it over?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.91,0:09:30.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he doing over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.03,0:09:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy's everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.47,0:09:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do this, Captain!\NPlease stop! We're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.99,0:09:49.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't reason with the\Ndoubt that he's started!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.17,0:09:53.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His sidestead maneuver is so fast,\Nnot even he knows what he's cutting!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.57,0:09:56.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how could he have killed\Nso many of us without even...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.15,0:09:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.55,0:10:05.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.69,0:10:07.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People are just getting cut to ribbons!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.93,0:10:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoo yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.51,0:10:26.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Butler!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.93,0:10:40.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you have any honor?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.91,0:10:43.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those men are your friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.35,0:10:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reef.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.87,0:11:14.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.39,0:11:16.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.97,0:11:19.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should have accepted\Nyour fate like a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.89,0:11:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now look what you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.69,0:11:24.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, my little\Npawns are still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.99,0:11:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.21,0:11:30.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it would have been better just\Nto let them die in the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.31,0:11:34.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.13,0:11:37.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have something to say? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.23,0:11:40.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.79,0:11:44.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will never be like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.27,0:11:45.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not will.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.99,0:11:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone like you can't be like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.97,0:11:55.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.21,0:11:58.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are going to die here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.77,0:12:01.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.09,0:12:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, leave the children be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.09,0:12:05.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll write the will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.53,0:12:07.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Kaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.15,0:12:11.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gonna kill you as soon\Nas you write that will!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.99,0:12:12.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silly girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.43,0:12:15.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you know you can't bargain with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.67,0:12:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Kuro specifically instructed\Nme to get rid of everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.71,0:12:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.61,0:12:32.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't do exactly as I say,\Nthen you won't get to kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.09,0:12:36.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ant, I won't write my will! Hold\Non! Hold on! Just calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.27,0:12:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be so hasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.49,0:12:40.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I absolutely have to get\Nyou to write that will!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.73,0:12:42.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop! Kaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.65,0:12:48.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, fine, I'll let\Nthe little brats go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.17,0:12:52.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in their condition, they won't\Nbe making too quick of a getaway.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.41,0:12:57.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget to sign your name. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.95,0:13:03.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I leave my entire
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.01,0:13:05.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fortune to my butler.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.37,0:13:09.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clad or yes very good this is your
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.57,0:13:13.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wheel all right excellent work now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.21,0:13:15.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember we had a deal you promised me
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.53,0:13:20.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you wouldn't kill them\Njust relax I know I.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.27,0:13:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may not look like it, but\NI'm regarded as an honest man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.97,0:13:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.59,0:13:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.13,0:13:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Step on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.04,0:13:29.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.96,0:13:30.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.87,0:13:31.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.78,0:13:32.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.70,0:13:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.61,0:13:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.52,0:13:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go! Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.51,0:13:36.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't help him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.01,0:13:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough of that hypno-freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.75,0:13:41.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let the girl go! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.41,0:13:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like I was followed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.53,0:13:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I'd better finish off\Nthe rich girl quickly, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.61,0:14:00.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was simply a war.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.09,0:14:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The real fight begins now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.99,0:14:10.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon I will be feasting on your feet,\Ncomplimented by the sweet wine of your agony.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.25,0:14:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.31,0:14:17.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of the back attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.01,0:14:39.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice try, you jerk! Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.17,0:14:41.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.11,0:14:44.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, Butler man, right now\Nyour life really sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.31,0:14:46.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your plan of three years is\Na complete and total failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.85,0:14:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.76,0:14:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, that weird\Nkid called Captain Kuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.25,0:14:51.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.35,0:14:53.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that goofy kid manages to beat him,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.47,0:14:57.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then that means Captain Kuro won't\Nbe able to slaughter us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.09,0:14:59.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.73,0:15:02.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, you don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.93,0:15:10.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid snot-nosed brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.97,0:15:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.88,0:15:16.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're one\Nstep too late, swordsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.29,0:15:17.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.11,0:15:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excellent!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.02,0:15:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That branch was getting\Nin the way of my shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.19,0:15:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.15,0:15:27.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.79,0:15:28.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.41,0:15:32.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eat this, hypnotist!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.01,0:15:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.92,0:15:35.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get him, you crazy rubber guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.13,0:15:37.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going dead, you mean bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.37,0:15:38.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.95,0:15:41.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.31,0:15:44.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no right to cheer me on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.67,0:15:45.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.93,0:15:52.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, time for the exploding star!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.41,0:15:56.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You insect!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.49,0:16:02.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My spirit will absolutely\Nnot be disrupted!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.71,0:16:17.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a kid, I never stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.39,0:16:19.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Searching for a great treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.97,0:16:24.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a map in my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.73,0:16:27.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That I knew would lead me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.37,0:16:31.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to find my way to that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.57,0:16:34.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before someone could beat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.47,0:16:38.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The promised land was in my grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.65,0:16:41.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I wouldn't let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.05,0:16:46.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My only dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.59,0:16:51.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't stop chasing
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.71,0:16:54.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it until it comes true!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.05,0:16:59.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if the world ever changes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.89,0:17:02.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I call out your name!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.05,0:17:09.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We return to the time when\Neverything's the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.91,0:17:16.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm with you,\Nmy memories won't fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.35,0:17:21.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waiting for that one true dream?

